      "created_at": "2018-05-26T12:20:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Because the merging of the various Haka’s into the two we know wasn’t instaneous. &nbsp;We got told Eternal Haka from the Final Wasteland was part of the OblivAeon fight and got absorbed into the two Haka’s before it was over. &nbsp;Overall, the explanation for Haka’s power source caused by La Comodora is essentially a massive Retcon. &nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:50:51.638Z",
