      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Because the merging of the various Haka&rsquo;s into the two we know wasn&rsquo;t instaneous. &nbsp;We got told Eternal Haka from the Final Wasteland was part of the OblivAeon fight and got absorbed into the two Haka&rsquo;s before it was over. &nbsp;Overall, the explanation for Haka&rsquo;s power source caused by La Comodora is essentially a massive Retcon. &nbsp;</p>",
